    {
      "commentary": {
        "commtxt": "Subrayen to Tadiwanashe Marumani, B0$ Caught by Jordan Hermann!! Nicely taken by Jordan Hermann! That was anything but an easy catch! It went miles up in the air and was swirling all the way down, but the fielder got underneath it and then had to dive at the last moment to take it just inches above the ground. Prenelan Subrayen bowled this a bit fuller, and Tadiwanashe Marumani miscued it towards extra cover trying to play the big shot. Got it off the toe end and Hermann then did the rest! B1$",
